    "details": {
      "cr": 3,
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>KORRUN SLAGLEDGER — CR 3 mini-boss. Scalewoven dwarf overseer (\"the warden\") of the staging mine near Dhul Maldur. Cold bureaucrat: slaves are quota &amp; ledger, clinical impersonal cruelty. Chain dominion — scaleweaving warps iron.</p><p><strong>Manual — Multiattack:</strong> one Overseer's Maul + one Chain Lash each turn (use both items).</p><p><strong>Manual — Chain Lash pull:</strong> on a hit the target makes a DC 14 Strength save or is pulled 10 ft toward Korrun.</p><p><strong>Manual — Dwarven Resilience:</strong> advantage on saves vs. poison (poison resistance is on the sheet).</p><p><strong>Manual — Tactics/Flee:</strong> uses normi conscript guards as shields, never risks himself. At bloodied (≤33 HP) or when his guards fall: Disengage, retreat into the mine via the chains, sound the alarm. He does NOT die here — recurs at the Dhul Maldur assault.</p>"
      }
    }
  },
